{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Four Elite Warriors (FEW)</strong> - Get ready for a team bloodbath! </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Tired of the same old action games? Looking for chaotic, wild fun with your pals?  Then Four Elite Warriors is the perfect game for you!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >In a local multiplayer deathmatch between two to four players, yo will be able to eliminate your fellows in such many ways, with diferents kind of weapons that will randomly spawn in the scenary,  that one, that you can choose before the match start. have you been hit and are you bleeding. and of course you don\u00b4t want to be one of the first bloods (it\u00b4s not so bad anyway, you will respawn in five seconds) you can pickup one of the health box. You are out of ammo, and are still shooting with no end, and harming no one? you can hit them or take one ammo box from field. Once match starts, you must be the first to reach five kills, (but not five deaths) to win the battle and everything starts over.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Gather three friends (or enemies) and get ready for an epic battle brimming with laughter, betrayal and explosions. Pick from a cast of loony characters and get rid of your opponents however you want:  </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Burn\u2018em, </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Shoot\u2019em, </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2896790/extras/90919d736befa70336b2484cca6264a4.poster.avif?t=1771284750\" width=548 height=308 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2896790/extras/90919d736befa70336b2484cca6264a4.webm?t=1771284750\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2896790/extras/90919d736befa70336b2484cca6264a4.mp4?t=1771284750\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Hammer them</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Make them explode</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2896790/extras/454057ffe8a7a73e5f4297f5a50084f8.poster.avif?t=1771284750\" width=444 height=250 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2896790/extras/454057ffe8a7a73e5f4297f5a50084f8.webm?t=1771284750\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2896790/extras/454057ffe8a7a73e5f4297f5a50084f8.mp4?t=1771284750\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Blow them away with your bazooka</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >And enjoy your victory in slow motion</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2896790/extras/94e2fb6bc2cf09033e1cf13b2aa55b97.poster.avif?t=1771284750\" width=378 height=212 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2896790/extras/94e2fb6bc2cf09033e1cf13b2aa55b97.webm?t=1771284750\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2896790/extras/94e2fb6bc2cf09033e1cf13b2aa55b97.mp4?t=1771284750\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Survivor mode will be availeble soon, so you can rest for killing each other and work together in co-op modem, you must survive as much hordes you can, but be careful, not everytinh is so simple, cause frindly fire it\u00b4s always on (so you can revenge from thoose who make you loose previously).</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Four Elite Warriors was crafted with love by Jamceco, an independent three-person studio from Argentina. Don\u2019t expect AAA graphics or a deep plot, but simply thrilling action, joy and plenty of chaos to enjoy with friends.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Play, enjoy and give us your positive review.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Bye</p>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/2896790?t=1771284750","background_raw":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2896790/page_bg_raw.jpg?t=1771284750","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2896790/748dbe99852508660a36a1dc6072c73dc64feedc/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1771284750","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2896790/748dbe99852508660a36a1dc6072c73dc64feedc/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1771284750","categories":[{"description":"Multi-player","id":1},{"description":"PvP","id":49},{"description":"Shared/Split Screen PvP","id":37},{"description":"Co-op","id":9},{"description":"Shared/Split Screen Co-op","id":39},{"description":"Shared/Split Screen","id":24},{"description":"Full controller support","id":28},{"description":"Custom Volume Controls","id":68},{"description":"Playable without Timed Input","id":74},{"description":"Stereo Sound","id":69},{"description":"Touch Only Option","id":77},{"description":"Remote Play Together","id":44},{"description":"Family Sharing","id":62}],"content_descriptors":{"ids":[2,5],"notes":null},"controller_support":"full","demos":[{"appid":3980200,"description":""}],"detailed_description":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Four Elite Warriors (FEW)</strong> - Get ready for a team bloodbath! </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Tired of the same old action games? Looking for chaotic, wild fun with your pals?  Then Four Elite Warriors is the perfect game for you!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >In a local multiplayer deathmatch between two to four players, yo will be able to eliminate your fellows in such many ways, with diferents kind of weapons that will randomly spawn in the scenary,  that one, that you can choose before the match start. have you been hit and are you bleeding. and of course you don\u00b4t want to be one of the first bloods (it\u00b4s not so bad anyway, you will respawn in five seconds) you can pickup one of the health box. You are out of ammo, and are still shooting with no end, and harming no one? you can hit them or take one ammo box from field. Once match starts, you must be the first to reach five kills, (but not five deaths) to win the battle and everything starts over.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Gather three friends (or enemies) and get ready for an epic battle brimming with laughter, betrayal and explosions. Pick from a cast of loony characters and get rid of your opponents however you want:  </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Burn\u2018em, </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Shoot\u2019em, </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2896790/extras/90919d736befa70336b2484cca6264a4.poster.avif?t=1771284750\" width=548 height=308 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2896790/extras/90919d736befa70336b2484cca6264a4.webm?t=1771284750\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2896790/extras/90919d736befa70336b2484cca6264a4.mp4?t=1771284750\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Hammer them</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Make them explode</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ct